# Section 7701 - Definitions

## (a)(1) Person

The term "person" shall be construed to mean and include an individual, a trust, estate, partnership, association, company or corporation.

```catala
declaration enumeration Person:
  -- Individual
  -- Trust
  -- Estate
  -- Partnership content Partnership
  -- Association
  -- Company
  -- Corporation content Corporation
```

## (a)(2) Partnership and partner

The term "partnership" includes a syndicate, group, pool, joint venture, or other unincorporated organization, through or by means of which any business, financial operation, or venture is carried on, and which is not, within the meaning of this title, a trust or estate or a corporation; and the term "partner" includes a member in such a syndicate, group, pool, joint venture, or organization.

```catala
declaration enumeration PartnershipOrganizationForm:
  -- Syndicate
  -- Group
  -- Pool
  -- JointVenture
  -- OtherUnincorporatedOrganization

declaration structure Partnership:
  data form content PartnershipOrganizationForm
  data business_carried_on content boolean
  data is_not_trust_estate_or_corporation content boolean
  data is_domestic content boolean

# Partner: member_of implies membership, no is_member field needed
declaration structure Partner:
  data member_of content Partnership
```

## (a)(3) Corporation

The term "corporation" includes associations, joint-stock companies, and insurance companies.

```catala
declaration enumeration CorporationForm:
  -- Association
  -- JointStockCompany
  -- InsuranceCompany

declaration structure Corporation:
  data form content CorporationForm
  data is_domestic content boolean
```

## (a)(4)-(5) Domestic and Foreign

The term "domestic" when applied to a corporation or partnership means created or organized in the United States or under the law of the United States or of any State unless, in the case of a partnership, the Secretary provides otherwise by regulations. The term "foreign" when applied to a corporation or partnership means a corporation or partnership which is not domestic.

```catala
declaration enumeration CorpOrPartnership:
  -- IsPartnership
  -- IsCorporation

declaration scope DomesticityDetermination:
  input entity content CorpOrPartnership
  input created_or_organized_in_us_or_under_law content boolean
  input secretary_override content boolean
  input secretary_decision content boolean
  output is_domestic content boolean

scope DomesticityDetermination:
  label base_rule
  definition is_domestic equals created_or_organized_in_us_or_under_law

  exception base_rule
  definition is_domestic
  under condition
    (match entity with pattern
    -- IsPartnership content p : true
    -- IsCorporation content c : false)
    and secretary_override
  consequence equals secretary_decision
```

## (a)(14) Taxpayer

The term "taxpayer" means any person subject to any internal revenue tax.

```catala
declaration structure TaxPayer:
  data person content Person
  data subject_to_tax content boolean
```

